{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47390","headline":"题北平沼 · 杜光庭","name":"题北平沼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桐柏真人曾此居，焚香厓下诵灵书。\n朝回时宴三山客，涧尽闲飞五色鱼。\n天柱一峰凝碧玉，神灯千点散红蕖。\n宝芝常在知谁得，好驾金蟾入太虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}